OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FPhillip is dizzy and
OL,7,     Fdisorientated, and his GP suspects
OL,8,     Fan amnesiac disorder. Already on
OL,9,     Fanti-anxiety meds, Karen may have
OL,10,     FPTSD, so is referred for
OL,11,     Fpsychiatric assessment.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FDr Nick Mani receives a critically
OL,14,     Fill one-day-old baby, and cricket
OL,15,     Flegend Dickie Bird is in for a
OL,16,     Ffollow-up. Documentary series
OL,17,     Ffilmed inside Barnsley casualty
OL,18,     Fdepartment.
