OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, A&E staff deal with
OL,7,     Fa disruptive man refusing to leave
OL,8,     Fhis wheelchair. In Norwich, an air
OL,9,     Fambulance brings in a man who
OL,10,     Fdrunkenly impaled himself on a
OL,11,     Fgraveyard fence.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA 60-year-old man is involved in a
OL,14,     Fhigh speed crash and it seems his
OL,15,     Fchest has taken the full force of
OL,16,     Fthe impact. A 70-year-old man
OL,17,     Fsuddenly collapses with symptoms
OL,18,     Fof a heart attack.
